{"id":184515854412970,"type":"artist","name":"The Box Tops","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":15,"info":{"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/64442eee255341b7ca08a9db3f768aa3/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"Procedentes de Memphis, Tennessee, los Box Tops estaban originalmente formados por Alex Chilton (voz solista y guitarra), Bill Cunningham (bajo, teclados y coros), John Evans (guitarra, teclados y coros), Danny Smythe (batería) y Gary Talley (guitarra y coros). \n\n \n\nEn agosto de 1967 (en pleno “verano del amor”) editan su primer single “The Letter”, el cual alcanza el nº 1 en las listas de USA donde permanecerá durante 4 semanas y del cual se llegan a vender más de 4 millones de copias .","tags":["60s","classic rock","rock","soul","oldies"]},"works":[{"id":187925858437395,"type":"song","name":"The Letter","artist":"The Box Tops","year":1967,"weight":21,"yt":"HIWY8UyW9bw","src":"books,charts,ensayos,singles","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[{"name":"The Ongoing History of New Music","n":3}],"lists":[{"id":212684728441441,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1967","rank":2,"scaruffi":null},{"id":157497903047680,"name":"Billboard Hot 100 nº1 · 1960s","rank":191,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","rank":2,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":3}},{"id":103821292291711,"type":"album","name":"The Letter / Neon Rainbow","artist":"The Box Tops","year":1967,"weight":3,"yt":"EH5XwcIlixY","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":147016066420574,"name":"RYM Top — R&B — Blue-Eyed Soul","rank":92,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":47641961053507,"type":"song","name":"Cry Like a Baby","artist":"The Box Tops","year":1968,"weight":4,"yt":"dmhtxLSUhYU","src":"charts,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":69206598009354,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1968","rank":16,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Y